                  "heading": "Guidelines & Additional Information"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Advance Notice: Some services require advance notification and submission of medical documents.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Medical Fitness: In certain cases, a Medical Information Form (MEDIF) may be required from your doctor.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Traveling with Assistance Devices: Mobility aids such as wheelchairs and crutches are carried free of charge, subject to space and safety regulations.",
